,"pos":[798.7171160566352,513.5254640890817],"size":[360,150],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"probe_handle","name":"probe_handle","type":"QWEN21_PROBE_HANDLE","link":11},{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":13}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"attention_data","name":"attention_data","type":"QWEN21_ATTENTION_DATA","links":[15]},{"localized_name":"ref_attention_mass","name":"ref_attention_mass","type":"FLOAT","links":[17]},{"localized_name":"metadata","name":"metadata","type":"STRING","links":[18]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Qwen21ReferenceAttentionProbing"},"widgets_values":[],"widgets_values_named":{}},{"id":13,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[1036.1169210028638,850.8832509269959],"size":[300,160],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"source","name":"source","type":"*","link":17}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":null}],"title":"Reference Attention Mass","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.39.0","Node name for S&R":"PreviewAny"},"widgets_values":[],"widgets_values_named":{}},{"id":14,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[1433.498559389036,784.6246398472593],"size":[520,320],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"source","name":"source","type":"*","link":18}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"STRING","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":null}],"title":"Attention Probe Metadata","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.39.0","Node name for S&R":"PreviewAny"},"widgets_values":[],"widgets_values_named":{}},{"id":15,"type":"Note","pos":[25.097064090498552,867.2242788138353],"size":[740,720],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Reference Attention Probe 输入说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Qwen21 Reference Attention Probe 输入说明\n\n这个节点只读取 Qwen-Image-2.1 的 Attention，不会修改 Q、K、V、Prompt 或参考图 Latent。\n\n- **model**：连接原生 Qwen-Image-2.1 diffusion model；节点 clone 模型后安装只读探针。\n- **enabled**：探针开关。关闭时模型直接通过，不注册 Hook。\n- **reference_index**：观察第几张参考图，从 `0` 开始，顺序与 Text Encode 节点的参考图输入一致。\n- **block_index**：捕获的 DiT Transformer Block 编号，从 `0` 开始；默认 `16`。\n- **head_index**：所选 Block 内的 Attention Head 编号，从 `0` 开始。\n- **capture_t**：一个或多个由英文逗号分隔的归一化时间点，例如 `0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1`。每个值范围为 `0–1`，每项保留实际采样中最接近它的一次 Forward；Attention Preview 的 Overlay 会按输入顺序组成 IMAGE batch。\n- **max_queries**：仅供 `uniform_1d` 使用，限制均匀抽取的 Target Query 数；不再限制为 256。\n- **batch_index**：所选条件分支内的 batch 项编号，从 `0` 开始。\n- **condition_branch**：捕获 `positive` 或 `negative` CFG 分支；CFG=1 通常选择 `positive`。\n- **sampling_mode**：`uniform_1d` 保留原有一维均匀抽样；`full_chunked` 遍历全部 Target Queries。\n- **query_chunk_size**：全量探测每批处理的 Query 数，可选 16、32、64、128；默认 32。\n\n### Reference Attention Mass\n\n`ref_attention_mass` 表示：选中目标 Query 的全部可见 Attention 中，平均有多少比例分配给当前 `reference_index` 对应的参考图。数值范围是 `0–1`；例如 `0.12` 表示约 12% 的 Attention 流向该参考图。当 `capture_t` 包含多个值时，FLOAT 输出保持兼容，只显示第一个目标时间点的 Mass；全部时间点的 Mass 请查看 Metadata 中的 `captures`。\n\n计算 Softmax 时分母包含文本、所有参考图和目标图 Token，不是只在当前参考图内部归一化。比较不同结果时应保持 `block_index`、`head_index`、`capture_t`、Mask 和 Prompt 一致。该数值表示模型在这一层读取参考图的强度，不等于真实因果贡献，也不能单独代表最终图像相似度。\n\n### 重要提示\n\n探针在 optimized-attention 调用处只读重算统计，不修改模型输出；full_chunked 会增加额外计算时间，但不保存完整 Query×Key 矩阵。`ref_attention_mass` 是流向该参考图的绝对 Attention 比例；Overlay 颜色只表示参考图内部的相对强弱；鼠标悬停可查看最近 Token 和双线性位置的原始 Attention。\n\n### Probing / Preview\n\nProbe 在 inference 中捕获；Probing 接收 probe_handle + samples 并输出 attention_data、mass、metadata；Attention Preview 接收 attention_data + reference_image，节点内显示 Overlay 且仅输出 overlay IMAGE。Reference Mask Preview 原样透传 MASK，悬停显示 opacity。\\n\\n### Prefix KV Cache\\n\\n工作流已连接 `Qwen Image 2.1 Cache`，默认 `device=auto`、`dtype=default`。连线顺序保持 Probe → Enhancer（如有）→ Cache → KSampler；Probe 使用 optimized-attention 只读观察，不会像旧版 attn1_patch 那样禁用 Prefix KV Cache。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Qwen21 Reference Attention Probe 输入说明\n\n这个节点只读取 Qwen-Image-2.1 的 Attention，不会修改 Q、K、V、Prompt 或参考图 Latent。\n\n- **model**：连接原生 Qwen-Image-2.1 diffusion model；节点 clone 模型后安装只读探针。\n- **enabled**：探针开关。关闭时模型直接通过，不注册 Hook。\n- **reference_index**：观察第几张参考图，从 `0` 开始，顺序与 Text Encode 节点的参考图输入一致。\n- **block_index**：捕获的 DiT Transformer Block 编号，从 `0` 开始；默认 `16`。\n- **head_index**：所选 Block 内的 Attention Head 编号，从 `0` 开始。\n- **capture_t**：一个或多个由英文逗号分隔的归一化时间点，例如 `0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1`。每个值范围为 `0–1`，每项保留实际采样中最接近它的一次 Forward；Attention Preview 的 Overlay 会按输入顺序组成 IMAGE batch。\n- **max_queries**：仅供 `uniform_1d` 使用，限制均匀抽取的 Target Query 数；不再限制为 256。\n- **batch_index**：所选条件分支内的 batch 项编号，从 `0` 开始。\n- **condition_branch**：捕获 `positive` 或 `negative` CFG 分支；CFG=1 通常选择 `positive`。\n- **sampling_mode**：`uniform_1d` 保留原有一维均匀抽样；`full_chunked` 遍历全部 Target Queries。\n- **query_chunk_size**：全量探测每批处理的 Query 数，可选 16、32、64、128；默认 32。\n\n### Reference Attention Mass\n\n`ref_attention_mass` 表示：选中目标 Query 的全部可见 Attention 中，平均有多少比例分配给当前 `reference_index` 对应的参考图。数值范围是 `0–1`；例如 `0.12` 表示约 12% 的 Attention 流向该参考图。当 `capture_t` 包含多个值时，FLOAT 输出保持兼容，只显示第一个目标时间点的 Mass；全部时间点的 Mass 请查看 Metadata 中的 `captures`。\n\n计算 Softmax 时分母包含文本、所有参考图和目标图 Token，不是只在当前参考图内部归一化。比较不同结果时应保持 `block_index`、`head_index`、`capture_t`、Mask 和 Prompt 一致。该数值表示模型在这一层读取参考图的强度，不等于真实因果贡献，也不能单独代表最终图像相似度。\n\n### 重要提示\n\n探针在 optimized-attention 调用处只读重算统计，不修改模型输出；full_chunked 会增加额外计算时间，但不保存完整 Query×Key 矩阵。`ref_attention_mass` 是流向该参考图的绝对 Attention 比例；Overlay 颜色只表示参考图内部的相对强弱；鼠标悬停可查看最近 Token 和双线性位置的原始 Attention。\n\n### Probing / Preview\n\nProbe 在 inference 中捕获；Probing 接收 probe_handle + samples 并输出 attention_data、mass、metadata；Attention Preview 接收 attention_data + reference_image，节点内显示 Overlay 且仅输出 overlay IMAGE。Reference Mask Preview 原样透传 MASK，悬停显示 opacity。\\n\\n### Prefix KV Cache\\n\\n工作流已连接 `Qwen Image 2.1 Cache`，默认 `device=auto`、`dtype=default`。连线顺序保持 Probe → Enhancer（如有）→ Cache → KSampler；Probe 使用 optimized-attention 只读观察，不会像旧版 attn1_patch 那样禁用 Prefix KV Cache。"},"color":"#233","bgcolor":"#355"},{"id":16,"type":"QwenImage21Cache","pos":[795.3175121876266,737.7615055500448],"size":[270,82],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":10},{"localized_name":"device","name":"device","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"dtype","name":"dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"MODEL","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[19]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.39.0","Node name for S&R":"QwenImage21Cache"},"widgets_values":["auto","default"],"widgets_values_named":{"device":"auto","dtype":"default"}},{"id":17,"type":"Qwen21ReferenceAttentionPreview","pos":[1208.7171160566352,513.5254640890817],"size":[360,320],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"attention_data","name":"attention_data","type":"QWEN21_ATTENTION_DATA","link":15},{"localized_name":"reference_image","name":"reference_image","type":"IMAGE","link":6},{"localized_name":"overlay_alpha","name":"overlay_alpha","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"overlay_alpha"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"visual_scale","name":"visual_scale","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"visual_scale"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"overlay","name":"overlay","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Qwen21ReferenceAttentionPreview"},"widgets_values":[0.55,"percentile_99"],"widgets_values_named":{"overlay_alpha":0.55,"visual_scale":"percentile_99"}}],"links":[[1,1,0,6,0,"MODEL"],[4,3,0,8,1,"VAE"],[6,4,0,17,1,"IMAGE"],[7,5,0,7,1,"CONDITIONING"],[8,5,1,7,2,"CONDITIONING"],[9,5,2,7,3,"LATENT"],[10,6,0,16,0,"MODEL"],[11,6,1,10,0,"QWEN21_PROBE_HANDLE"],[12,7,0,8,0,"LATENT"],[13,7,0,10,1,"LATENT"],[14,8,0,9,0,"IMAGE"],[15,10,0,17,0,"QWEN21_ATTENTION_DATA"],[17,10,1,13,0,"*"],[18,10,2,14,0,"*"],[2,2,0,5,0,"CLIP"],[5,4,0,5,1,"IMAGE"],[3,3,0,5,4,"VAE"],[19,16,0,7,0,"MODEL"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"workflow_name":"Qwen21 Reference Attention Probe","ds":{"scale":1.6776889214629456,"offset":[-561.8473310304831,44.8191936950274]}},"version":0